{"title": "Mobile: Evade Difficult Terrain", "pageid": 21450, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mobile:_Evade_Difficult_Terrain", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain.webp/300px-Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain.webp, /w/images/9/98/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain.webp/300px-Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mobile: Evade Difficult Terrain</b> is a passive feature that allows a character to ignore <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Difficult Terrain\">Difficult Terrain</a> after <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dashing</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a> doesn't slow you down. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Mobile\" title=\"Mobile\">Mobile</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dadger\" title=\"Dadger\">Dadger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dextor\" title=\"Dextor\">Dextor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Erus\" title=\"Erus\">Erus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Faona\" title=\"Faona\">Faona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gald\" title=\"Gald\">Gald</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Galleass\" title=\"Galleass\">Galleass</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gurira\" title=\"Gurira\">Gurira</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Heen\" title=\"Heen\">Heen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Helenia\" title=\"Helenia\">Helenia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jacko\" title=\"Jacko\">Jacko</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Loretta\" title=\"Loretta\">Loretta</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moke\" title=\"Moke\">Moke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morra\" title=\"Morra\">Morra</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Smathers\" title=\"Smathers\">Smathers</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thamberg\" title=\"Thamberg\">Thamberg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/The_Warden\" title=\"The Warden\">The Warden</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Theoda\" title=\"Theoda\">Theoda</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Triava\" title=\"Triava\">Triava</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yonni\" title=\"Yonni\">Yonni</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p><b>Mobile</b> does not prevent movement speed reduction from all Difficult Terrain types, only:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Mud_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Mud (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain: Mud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Mud_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Mud (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain: Mud</a> from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mud\" title=\"Mud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mud\" title=\"Mud\">Mud</a> surfaces</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Vines_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Vines (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain: Vines\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Vines_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Vines (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain: Vines</a> from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twisting_Vines\" title=\"Twisting Vines\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Roots_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Roots_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Roots_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Twisting Vines\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Roots_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Twisting_Vines\" title=\"Twisting Vines\">Twisting Vines</a> surfaces</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204438\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2026/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17229/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7892/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1039/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1025437/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.983      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   57.983      1 -total\n 43.83%   25.414      4 Template:Cond\n 29.20%   16.929      6 Template:Icon_link\n 28.06%   16.271      6 Template:Icon_text\n 24.58%   14.253      4 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 23.04%   13.357     12 Template:Trim\n 18.84%   10.922      2 Template